00:04:06.505 --> 00:04:07.065
So

00:04:08.025 --> 00:04:11.065
what's being proposed is a crossing

00:04:11.465 --> 00:04:14.345
of a wetlands of two wetlands

00:04:14.425 --> 00:04:15.545
areas. They actually,

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.780
we believe they're intermittent streams,

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:23.180
during the wet season. There can be some, you

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:25.980
know, a few inches of water that'll collect, especially,

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:27.660
after

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:29.580
a good rain,

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:30.940
event happens.

00:04:33.015 --> 00:04:34.935
The crossing goes over,

00:04:36.535 --> 00:04:38.775
you know, what is kind of a corridor,

00:04:39.735 --> 00:04:40.455
behind,

00:04:41.255 --> 00:04:45.015
the cul de sac and actually all the way behind Pine Ridge Drive.

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:47.020
The

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:47.980
access

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.380
to rear lots behind

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.060
the

